ual\": \"Categories page correctly shows per-category available counts (Furniture 3). Clicking Furniture navigates to /?category=furniture, but the browse list shows all 8 available listings from every category (Sports, Electronics, Toys, Home Decor included) and the count reads \\\"8 items available\\\"; the Furniture filter checkbox remains unchecked (value=false).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Seller has no view of received purchase requests; request confirmation is unverifiable/unbacked\", \"actual\": \"Emma sent a purchase-request message (\\\"QA-REQUEST-42…\\\") on Marcus's prod-2 and also used cart \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" (toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\", cart emptied). Signing in as Marcus, no request is visible anywhere: My Listings shows only listings (View/Mark Sold/Delete), the owner product page shows only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\", and the \\\"My Profile\\\" menu item leads to a 404 page. No requested-item or buyer-message view exists.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with nobody-unregistered@example.com → error banner \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", stayed on /login, no session created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering \\\"EMMA@Example.com\\\" (case variant of existing emma@example.com) rejected with \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\"; stayed on /register, no session created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password is not verified; any password authenticates a registered account\", \"actual\": \"Signing in as emma@example.com with password \\\"definitely-wrong-password-xyz\\\" succeeded: redirected to home page with signed-in header (Sell link shown). Login page itself states \\\"(any password works)\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Emma viewing Marcus's prod-2 sees only Add to Cart / Message Seller (no manage/edit/delete/mark-sold controls); Marcus viewing his own prod-2 sees \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" and no buyer actions. My Listings for Marcus lists only prod-2 and prod-6 (his own).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by required-field validation on title/description/price (native messages); with text filled but no category/condition → toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\"; with all fields but no photo → toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\". No listing created in any case.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price -25 blocked: input min=0, validationMessage \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\", stayed on /create-listing with no listing created. Non-numeric text cannot be entered (input type=number rejects \\\"abc\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Protected pages render a blank screen instead of a sign-in prompt or redirect\", \"actual\": \"Good: Add to Cart while signed out redirects to /login, and Message Seller's send button is disabled reading \\\"Log in to message\\\". But visiting /cart, /create-listing or /my-listings while unauthenticated leaves the URL unchanged and renders an entirely empty page (body innerText length 0, only the toast containers in the DOM) — no redirect and no sign-in prompt, even after waiting.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Duplicate-email submit shows immediate visible error banner \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\" while the registration form stays rendered and editable for correction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\",